  "title": "Qt: Fix Flow Graph y axis column widths",
  "description": "By default QCPAxisRect auto resizes to what is visible, which creates\nsome slight but noticeably distracting horizontal movement when\nscrolling vertically. Fix the sizes to prevent that.\n\nThe time str in a sequence item is set by set_fd_time and has the\nsame formatting as a COL_CLS_TIME column. There's no associated\ncolumn, so make get_column_longest_string public and use it.\n\nThe comment axis also needs to be fixed in size to avoid the wobble.\nThere we know what size we're eliding to.\n\nFix #12931",
